    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n33396" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Pagĭdas</span></b>  or <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Pagĭda</span></b> , ae, m.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>A river in Africa</i>, <i><span class="en">Tac. A. 3,
			20</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>A river in Phœnicia</i>, <i>near Mount Carmel</i>, <i>also called Belus</i>,
				<i><span class="en">Plin.
				5, 19, 17, § 75</span></i> (Jahn, Pacida). </div>
